 html←{parms}Markdown2HTML md;ns
 :If 0=⎕NC'parms'
     parms←M.CreateParms
     parms.cssURL←'./Assets/CSS'
     parms.smoothScrolling←0
 :EndIf
 ns←M.Init parms md
 ns←M.Process ns
 html←ns.parms M.MakeHTML_Doc ns.html                ⍝ Since MarkAPL 16 `Init` leaves `parms` alone: what it established is in `ns.parms`
⍝Done
